cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the committed data, please cite the paper and the Zenodo deposit."
title: "Analysis code for: Selective depletion of upper-layer somatostatin interneuron subtypes in schizophrenia"
abstract: >-
  Code and committed figure inputs for a study of cell-type-specific changes in
  schizophrenia, combining a seven-dataset snRNA-seq meta-analysis, Xenium spatial
  transcriptomics, common-variant genetics and patch-seq physiology.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/stripathy/scz_celltype_paper"
